api-6859cf8794-8cgxh   10.244.0.5   shorty-control-plane   0
$ kubectl get pods -A --sort-by=.metadata.name -o custom-columns='NAMESPACE:.metadata.namespace,NAME:.metadata.name' | sed -n '1,8p'
